<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Mexico's Ahmsa lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mexico's Ahmsa lowered.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banacci brokerage on Monday lowered its recommendation on Mexican steel company Altos Hornos de Mexico SA de CV (Ahmsa) to neutral from buy, Banacci said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Analyst Arturo Espinoza said Ahmsa shares have appreciated 19 percent since Bancci gave them a buy recommendation on July 23, while Banacci saw no change in Ahmsa's year-end 1998 target price of 28 pesos.</p>
<p>--In Mexico, Ahmsa shares fell 20 centavos to 21.50 pesos on Monday. In New York, Ahmsa ADRs closed down 1/4 to $14.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
